sequenceDiagram
    title SPI & EXTI Logic Level Timing
    participant GPIO as DATA_READY (GPIO)
    participant CS as SPI CS (Active Low)
    participant MISO as SPI MISO (STM32 TX)
    participant Pi as Raspberry Pi
    Note over GPIO,Pi: Clock CLK = 10 ms
    Note over GPIO,Pi: Initial State: DR=LOW, CS=HIGH, MISO=LOW
    Note over GPIO,Pi: Time 0 ms: Pi waits for interrupts
    Note over GPIO,Pi: <b>STM32 Alerts</b> when interrupt detected
    Note over GPIO,Pi: 25 ms: Pi Kernel asserts CS
    GPIO->>CS: CS=LOW - Active
    Note over GPIO,Pi: 30 ms: Data shifting starts
    CS->>GPIO: MISO data starts to shift out
    Note over GPIO,Pi: 80 ms: Data shifting complete
    CS->>GPIO: MISO data is fully shifted
    Note over GPIO,Pi: 85 ms: Pi releases bus
    CS->>GPIO: CS=HIGH - Inactive
    Note over GPIO,Pi: 90 ms: STM32 clears alert
